B.Ta=s(["Who, me? I didn't take anything... *hides acorn*","Your trash cans are *chef's kiss*","I regret nothing!","Oops, was that yours?","Finders keepers!"],t.s)
B.Qj=s(["Ooh, what's this shiny thing?","I wonder what's over there...","Have you ever tried eating a pinecone?","Tell me everything about this place!","*sniffs everything*"],t.s)
B.Re=s(["Is there more food? Asking for a friend... me.","*munch munch munch*","I came for the buffet.","My belly is my compass.","Snacks? SNACKS!"],t.s)
B.RI=s(["Oh! You can see me?","*peeks from behind tail*","I'll just... sit here quietly...","Please don't tell anyone I was here.","Is it safe?"],t.s)
B.Ry=s(["The night is young!","*yawns* Morning already?","Stars are extra sparkly tonight.","I do my best work after dark.","Moonlight becomes me."],t.s)
